OL,3,ASusan Sarandon leads tributes to Rocky
OL,4,AHorror Picture Show co-star Tim Curry
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a career spanning six decades, the
OL,7,Fprolific actor left his mark on both
OL,8,Ftheatre and film, ranging from Home
OL,9,FAlone 2 and Annie to Stephen King's It
OL,10,Fand The Hunt for Red October.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
